Here's something that I discovered recently that is not mentioned
in the spoiler files and has not been mentioned in the recent
discussion of which class is best:



Priests kick things incredibly well, maybe even as well as Samurai
Characters. Don't even bother using your mace until you've enchanted it >+3,
or unless you're fighting something small such as a Leprechaun, Killer Bee,
or Soldier Ant- just kick them! Kicking also works great on locked chests,
as you might have discovered, but the Priests I play, such as Tammy Fae,
do an even better job than the Samurai at kicking chests open.


